    "general_information": [
      {
        "type": "GeneralTitle",
        "content": "General Information",
        "groupId": "53c36f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
        "position": 0,
        "area": "General"
      },
      {
        "type": "GeneralText",
        "content": "<p><strong>DATED MATERIAL, SUBJECT TO CHANGE. PLEASE CONSULT CURRENT UCSD GENERAL CATALOG FOR ANY ADDITIONAL INFORMATION. </strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Special Advising Note: Transfer students are strongly advised to complete as many preparatory courses as soon as possible for their major before enrolling at UC San Diego. Preparing well for the major helps students move efficiently toward graduation. </strong></p><p><br></p><p>The Media program is designed for students who want to redefine the possibilities of photography, video, film and sound. The curriculum immerses candidates in the creative world of time-based practices. Based in conceptual and practical production, the program provides historical, social and aesthetic backgrounds for the understanding of modern media, and emphasizes creativity, versatility and intelligence over technical specializations. Media Honors Program available for qualified students.For more information please visit <a href=\"http://visarts.ucsd.edu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">visarts.ucsd.edu</a>.</p>",
        "groupId": "64c36f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
        "position": 1,
        "area": "General"
      },
      {
        "type": "GeneralText",
        "content": "<p>UC&nbsp;San&nbsp;Diego&nbsp;Advanced&nbsp;Placement&nbsp;(AP)&nbsp;and&nbsp;International&nbsp;Baccalaureate&nbsp;(IB)&nbsp;credit&nbsp;policies&nbsp;are&nbsp;detailed&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;links&nbsp;below:</p><p></p><p>Advanced&nbsp;Placement&nbsp;(AP)&nbsp;<a href=\"https://catalog.ucsd.edu/_files/advanced-placement-credit-chart-2026.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://catalog.ucsd.edu/_files/advanced-placement-credit-chart-2026.pdf</a></p><p></p><p>International&nbsp;Baccalaureate&nbsp;(IB)&nbsp;<a href=\"https://catalog.ucsd.edu/_files/international-baccalaureate-credits-chart-2026.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://catalog.ucsd.edu/_files/international-baccalaureate-credits-chart-2026.pdf</a></p>",
        "groupId": "d2c66f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
        "position": 2,
        "area": "General"
      }
